  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">URFBV Sikasso Livestock Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Livestock.Beneficiaries: 3271 (71 women).Description: The group will develop four (4) sites where animals can be gathered and put into trucks for delivery. Each site will include a fenced park, a borehole, a warehouse and a shed. These will faciltate contracting with LAHAM sloughterhouse. The group will also strengthen its capacity in animal fattening to meet LAHAM standards and financial management to facilitate loan procurement from banks to fund animal purchase by selected herders. The Union will shift from individual marketing of animals to marketing under the Union umbrella.</narrative>
  </description>
